Package: BExTEsim
Type: Package
Title: Simulation Studies of Bayesian Extrapolation Methods
Description: Runs simulation studies of the borrowing methods in 'BExTE'.
    It reads YAML configurations of case studies, scenarios and methods,
    simulates the frequentist and Bayesian operating characteristics of each
    method over a grid of scenarios, in parallel if asked, and writes the
    results to files. It then summarises the results in plots and tables.
Version: 0.1.0
